# Ruling 2024-09-20: "If the enchanted creature gains an ability after Duskmourn's Domination becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability."
# Bot1 takes Bot2's Ornithopter (flying lost), then enchants it with Flight on a later turn: the later timestamp gives it flying again (CR 613.7a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Duskmourn's Domination
Flight
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duskmourn's Domination.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flight.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -3
